# Issue this host's certificate and make unattended renewal reload nginx.
#
# No `unless`: the renewal hooks below have to be reconciled on every run —
# they carry a migration for lineages issued before the hooks moved into the
# per-lineage configuration — and an existing certificate is only half of what
# this unit is responsible for. The certificate issuance guards itself.
kind: action
capabilities: web-server
requires: web-packages, certbot-dns, web-services
root: yes
